abstract: >-
  Python notebooks for processing complementary dynamic-headspace and
  dynamic-solution-injection Vocus HR-CI-TOF-MS measurements of methyl
  linoleate oxidation, including normalisation, blank subtraction, feature
  selection, data fusion, correlation analysis and temporal-profile figures.
